NUM-26: scale an on-sag inlet by its own street's sides

getOnSagCapturedFlow() reproduced legacy's stale Nsides on purpose through
InletSolver::nsides_prev_, the sides of the previously processed inlet's
street. Use the inlet's own g.nsides, and remove nsides_prev_, its seeding
in init() and its updates in computeAll(), which have no other use.

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply NUM-26_swmm600.patch

